  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 1612775577}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    activeTutoUi: 0
    setForm: 0
    form: 0
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "Oh qu\u2019est ce que tu fous ! R\xE9veille toi ! Tu viens \xE0
      peine de reprendre et tu glandes d\xE9j\xE0\u2026"
    dialogueEN: "Oh what the hell are you doing! Wake up! You just started over and
      you\u2019re already chilling..."
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 1
    ativeAtk: 1
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 1
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 1768870673}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 1700577933}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    activeTutoUi: 0
    setForm: 0
    form: 0
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "Fais comme d'habitude, nettoie ce r\xEAve et r\xE9cup\xE8re ce foutu
      noyau. Je te surveille."
    dialogueEN: "Do as usual, clean up this dream and get this damn core. I\u2019m
      watching you."
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 0
    ativeAtk: 0
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 0
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 0}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 977070194}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    activeTutoUi: 5
    setForm: 0
    form: 1
    asDialogue: 0
    dialogueFR: 
    dialogueEN: 
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 0
    ativeAtk: 4
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 1
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 1316928781}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 261345079}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    activeTutoUi: 2
    setForm: 0
    form: 0
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "Je te rappelle que tu as un quota \xE0 remplir, alors nettoie ces
      tas de poussi\xE8res !"
    dialogueEN: I remind you that you must hit your quota, so clean up these piles
      of dust!
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 0
    ativeAtk: 0
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 1
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 1501724258}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 662206931}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    activeTutoUi: 7
    setForm: 0
    form: 0
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "Pense bien \xE0 v\xE9rifier ton t\xE9l\xE9phone pour voir o\xF9
      tu en es au niveau de ton quota."
    dialogueEN: "Make sure to check your phone to see how you\u2019re doing with
      your quota."
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 0
    ativeAtk: 0
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 1
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 2104164556}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 1141386771}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    activeTutoUi: 6
    setForm: 0
    form: 0
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "C\u2019est nous qui te donnons acc\xE8s \xE0 ta puissance de cr\xE9ation,
      alors fais bien ton taff pour acc\xE9der \xE0 la suite du r\xEAve !"
    dialogueEN: We are the ones who give you access to your creation power, so make
      sure you're doing your job well to access the rest of the dream!
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 0
    ativeAtk: 0
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 0
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 0}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 439222631}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    activeTutoUi: 0
    setForm: 0
    form: 0
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "Tiens, j\u2019esp\xE8re que tu ne les as pas oubli\xE9s, eux, nettoie
      ce Zonyr qui d\xE9gueulasse le r\xEAve."
    dialogueEN: "Well, I hope you haven\u2019t forgotten them, clean up this Zonyr
      who makes the dream dirty."
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 0
    ativeAtk: 0
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 0
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 0}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 1305260524}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    activeTutoUi: 1
    setForm: 0
    form: 0
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "T\u2019es d\xE9j\xE0 bless\xE9 ? Bah, sers-toi de ces poussi\xE8res
      \xE9tincelantes pour te soigner. \r\n(MAINTENIR A)"
    dialogueEN: "Already injured? Well, use this sparkling dust to heal yourself.
      \r\n(MAINTAIN A)"
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 1
    ativeAtk: 2
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 1
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 1608075721}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 1589093519}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    activeTutoUi: 6
    setForm: 0
    form: 0
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "Si tu effaces les \xE9l\xE9ments que tu as cr\xE9\xE9s, tu peux
      r\xE9cup\xE9rer ta puissance de cr\xE9ation."
    dialogueEN: If you erase the elements you created, you can recover your creation
      power.
    setNumberOfPointsForErased: 0
    changeIndicator: 0
    ativeAtk: 0
    numberOfPointsForErased: 0
    hadUI: 0
    temporateUI: 0
    timeOfUI: 0
    uiObject: {fileID: 0}
  - colliderTrigger: {fileID: 631205111}
    disponibleForms: 00000000
    activeTutoUi: 0
    setForm: 0
    form: 0
    asDialogue: 1
    dialogueFR: "Tu peux aussi effacer tout les \xE9l\xE9ments que tu as cr\xE9er
      en te concentrant.\r\n(MAINTENIR R1)"
    dialogueEN: 'You can also erase all the elements you have created by concentrating.

